My dream:
&quot;Good evening, sir. May I take your coat?&quot;
&quot;Dinner will be ready in about 20 minutes. Your guests said they will be arriving very shortly&quot;
&quot;May I serve you a drink while you relax in the sitting room?&quot;<p>The reality:
&quot;Good morning sir. Would you care for some assistance getting out of bed?&quot;
&quot;Please let me know if I can give you any help with your morning routine.&quot;
&quot;Your low salt, heart healthy high fiber breakfast is ready now, and I have all your pill bottles lined up on the table for your approval.&quot;
